(text "J4 Molex Micro-Fit 3.0 right-angle 43650-0200 on the left edge under J1 (mating 43645-0200, contacts 43030), latched, 5 A. Protection: F1 2 A slow-blow; D2 SMBJ36A before D1: silent at 35 V (ISO 16750-2 B), clamps ISO 7637-2 pulses to ~50 V." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 17.78 87.63 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "c7af216a-0b36-5817-b594-15011b6177b7"))
(text "3V3_AON (U5) always: FOT, U1, U2, U4, U11. Parked (the ring asleep) up to ~60 uA in all: the FOT asleep <= 25, logic, LDO 2.7." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 17.78 91.44 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "a5789fa7-33c3-5308-bb76-59d4ecc88467"))
(text "5V_SW (U6 LMR38020, 80 V, 400 kHz) on WAKE: the FPGA module, U14 (3V3_DA, block 9). VOUT 5.31 V. C44/C45 + L2 22 uH: harness ringing damped, 400 kHz kept out." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 17.78 95.25 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "87accc1a-18a4-5804-8377-43390c7fa260"))
(text "5V_HOST (U10): M2's supply (ESP32), limit ~1 A (R22 24k9): the module's radio draws peaks over 0.5 A; 5 V from the module's USB does not flow back into 5V_SW." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 17.78 99.06 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "e9351c53-cbce-53f1-b7f2-35c4a6869b42"))
