(text "Pins 1..20 / 21..40 top to bottom, from the USB-C; name = the GW2AR pin + what the module has on it (data sheet v1.3)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 279.4 184.15 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "fda03ae6-9807-5118-9684-53fd7b13fa7f"))
(text "The ring and the Si514 on the LCD pins only (an empty connector): LOCK on 31, S/PDIF on 42. HSPI, 54..56 (the module amplifier's inputs; PA_EN = 51 keeps it off), EDID 52/53: UART, MCLK, I2S, SD1, DIN2." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 279.4 187.96 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "ed944b3c-497e-5348-9e35-e611974e6b0e"))
(text "CLK_1024 (Si514) -> 77 (GCLKT_1). TX_FB -> 25 through IDES8 (1.26 ns); it takes the pair, so 26 is not connected." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 279.4 191.77 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "62f3743e-7d6d-53fb-b701-7300c6a45ff4"))
(text "D3: the USB and 5V_SW are never joined; U6 gives 5.3 V, the module gets ~5.0 V." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 279.4 195.58 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "82f0c72e-4819-5bbe-9e45-25f2f8374f52"))
(text "v1.2: lines to the right leave the right row as J2, J3, DAC, host; U13's (SRC_BCLK, SRC_LRCK, DIN2) the left row, over M1." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 279.4 110.49 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "14cdc360-b11d-5373-89e4-182e1d001d45"))
(rectangle (start 12.7 203.2) (end 203.2 284.48) (stroke (width 0.254) (type dash) (color 72 72 160 1)) (fill (type none)) (uuid "7766a993-ec66-5973-bc58-2828e16ff99b"))
(text "6. THE REGENERATION CLOCK   Si514 = 1024 x the ring's FS (45.16 / 49.15 MHz), steered by the FPGA" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 13.97 207.01 0) (effects (font (size 2 2) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "0a9b3a01-fa5f-59f1-83d8-6127371af5a0"))
