(label "RT_CLK" (at 133.35 246.38 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "1a5217a6-3194-5f17-a357-83b5bb5a8a0c"))
(text "U7 Si514: any off-the-shelf 3.3 V CMOS one - after 514 in the part number the letter C, M or N; package 3.2x5 or 2.5x3.2 (the letter before AG: B or C), both fit one land pattern." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 17.78 265.43 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "1208231d-ac3c-584e-a151-b784d57dce51"))
(text "CLK+ -> FPGA (clk_r = 1024 Fs) and through R15 to U9: the TX edges sit on the Si514's clock, not on the FPGA's output. CLK- is not needed." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 17.78 269.24 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "ebd73c0f-f28f-5717-8320-d0bf0229b004"))
(text "The FPGA finds the Si514's I2C address itself (it tries 0x08..0x77) and steers M (dpll.v): TX_FB's delay against RX_IN within 1.26 ns, steps of 0.026 ppb." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 17.78 273.05 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "928efa3f-3cd5-5f72-8c75-11778c295815"))
(text "At start-up, centring (FCAL, up to 10 ms): the Si514's output is high-impedance then, R14 and R17 hold the lines at 0. U8: its own LDO from 5V_SW." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 17.78 276.86 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "7cb6790d-fea7-5b51-a5d0-38dce7542a9a"))
(rectangle (start 208.28 203.2) (end 406.4 284.48) (stroke (width 0.254) (type dash) (color 72 72 160 1)) (fill (type none)) (uuid "32a0f872-365d-5494-a9c0-089922604240"))
(text "7. OUTPUTS   J2: analyser (MCLK, 2 x TDM8, UART_TX);   J3: stereo I2S for a DAC / DSP" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 209.55 207.01 0) (effects (font (size 2 2) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "6c5b8148-1c55-5fb5-96cd-8206cc0c90bd"))
