(text "C31 J6; C32/C33 U12 VDD; C34/C35 U12 VCC;" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 325.12 381 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "953604fa-4712-5884-b9c5-9eed6d03952a"))
(text "C36/C37 U13 VDD; C38 U13 VIO; C39 X1: by the pins." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 325.12 384.81 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "d8aa45d9-0aca-5bd3-aaac-3f2af1c72f84"))
(text "J5 TOSLINK IN -> R25 -> U12 DIR9001: its PLL recovers the clock from the signal, output I2S 24 bit (FMT1 FMT0 = HH), CKSEL = L. XTI to ground: no crystal needed." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 17.78 373.38 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "f30bd850-c2ca-59dd-b758-356ea31d4c52"))
(text "U13 SRC4192: both ports slave (MODE = 000); input I2S 24 bit (IFMT = 001) from U12; output I2S 24 bit (OFMT = 01, OWL = 00) on the FPGA's clocks (their own copies of BCLK, LRCK: SRC_BCLK_F, SRC_LRCK_F) -> I2S_DIN2_F." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 17.78 377.19 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "02d167f9-e3f1-5934-9b1a-38c131bd3117"))
(text "X1 24.576 MHz: the reference clock of the SRC4192's rate estimator (RCKI), asynchronous to both ports. RST_AIN: R30/C40 = 10 ms, once X1 runs (the SRC4192 has no POR)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 17.78 381 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "3e6e94e7-530d-5977-81e8-a512acd7fe24"))
(text "OPT_ERR (U12 ERROR) -> M2 IO13: 1 = no TOSLINK signal or a parity error; OPT_NPCM (U12 AUDIO) -> M2 IO27: 1 = not PCM (the DIR9001 does not mute AC-3/DTS); the host then does not inject. Source: command 02, bit M[2]." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 17.78 384.81 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "eceb1480-0de0-5dd9-8dfb-112ce74d80c5"))
(text "S/PDIF OUT: SPDIF_F (FPGA 42) -> R28 -> J6 FCR684208T; R26/R27: 0.5 V into 75 ohm, 75 ohm out; C29 blocks DC -> J7 RCA. The same stream as on J3." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 17.78 388.62 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "96e44ebf-1169-5a11-9bbe-0801d8301e4a"))
(rectangle (start 411.48 289.56) (end 523.24 360.68) (stroke (width 0.254) (type dash) (color 72 72 160 1)) (fill (type none)) (uuid "34cb8c4d-8fe7-5750-88c1-a297061873f1"))
