(symbol (lib_id "most_listener:3V3_DAC") (at 436.88 116.84 0) (unit 1) (exclude_from_sim no) (in_bom no) (on_board yes) (dnp no) (uuid "7b462e6b-2db0-5cfd-98a3-d6063abff42d")
