  (instances (project "most_listener_v2" (path "/eacb6e4e-2fc7-5b7e-9036-1fa0907ec568" (reference "#PWR176") (unit 1)))))
(text "U15 PCM5102A, hardware mode: FMT = 0 (I2S), FLT = 0 (normal latency), DEMP = 0. SCK to ground: the PLL takes its clock from BCK (3 wires, BCK = 64 Fs)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 414.02 134.62 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "7ad288e2-52d6-57f2-b08c-b4cee46d6d18"))
(text "Its input is the same stereo as J3's. XSMT = LOCK: the DAC is muted while the ring is not locked and before the FPGA is configured (R8); it ramps over 104 samples." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 414.02 138.43 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "766849a8-e45c-5e46-8877-0396f24f0c78"))
(text "Output 2.1 Vrms ground-referenced, no coupling caps. U17: buffer with a 2nd-order Sallen-Key low-pass (Butterworth, 60 kHz), C0G; then 100 ohm + 2.2 nF, D5, D6 (ESD) at the RCA." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 414.02 142.24 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "e7d37339-6992-514a-9235-f256378530ec"))
(text "U17 on +5V_SW and VNEG_A (-5.2 V, U18 TPS60403): output to the rails, input to V-, so +-3 V of signal fits with margin. J8, J9 pad 3: as J7's, measure a sample." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 414.02 146.05 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "1d28ef56-7da1-52cb-85bb-b6d480c11b7b"))
(text "U16 LP5907: 3V3_DAC from 5V_SW. Its output takes at most 10 uF, so AVDD 4.7 uF and CPVDD 2.2 uF instead of fig. 33's 10 uF." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 414.02 149.86 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "e1419f99-a636-5260-b612-aeb81d29e5f8"))
(text "On the board each capacitor of the row stands by its pin: C52, C53 CPVDD; C54, C55 AVDD; C56 DVDD." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 414.02 153.67 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "837dc96d-67a2-5ce5-a1b4-2004f443569c"))
