(label "RX_IN_U3" (at 492.76 215.9 180) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify right bottom)) (uuid "b651ed51-687f-5626-b03a-416e2a22c5a6"))
(label "RX_IN" (at 515.62 215.9 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "4a9f43c9-8703-5e55-95a6-799ea5c82515"))
(text "U17 (OPA1678) no longer runs straight off the rails: V+ = 5V_A (5V_SW via R47 10 ohm, C84 10 uF; it feeds U16, the DAC's LDO, too), V- = VNEG_A (U18's VNEG_P via R48 10 ohm, C85 10 uF)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 414.02 236.22 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "65915671-44e2-56b2-8f60-a92ff41762f3"))
(text "RC 10 ohm / 10 uF: corner 1.6 kHz, ~45 dB at 250 kHz (the pump) and the buck's frequency; R47 drops up to 0.2 V (U17 + U16 with the DAC), R48 ~50 mV. A bead with 10 uF would ring at tens of kHz." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 414.02 240.03 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "0d2fa047-8a79-547e-ae87-0e2d18e3935f"))
(text "R49-R51: 33 ohm at the FPGA on the I2S branch to the DAC and ESP32 (BCLK, LRCK, DOUT: 35-45 mm, many loads; the DAC clocks off BCLK). J3: R39-R41." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 414.02 243.84 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "37b2612e-7f36-5abd-a7e8-f62fa74331c9"))
(text "R52: 33 ohm at U3's output (RX_IN to the FPGA, about 60 mm)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 414.02 247.65 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "fdc670b0-ec76-5dee-8660-606ceeda8072"))
(text "R53: 33 ohm at U1's output (RX_BUF to U2, U3, U4; through U2 and R2 the ring's TX), as R43 in the reader v2.0; drawn in block 3." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 414.02 251.46 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "d61b2966-800e-544d-895d-fff16b5a494d"))
